+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/people/{personId}/merge — a steward merges the person into another on the sheet. Body
+# {"intoId":123}. The merged person's claims move to the other (numbers and dates kept, each losing any figure a
+# statement bound, listed after the other's in the order they were added); their name and aliases become the
+# other's aliases; their patrons and pool memberships go to the other, and anyone naming them as patron names the
+# other instead. Their statements, holds, watchers and contact are dropped and they leave the sheet. 422, storing
+# nothing, for anyone but a steward, the same person, no such person, or either of them retired; 404 for a person
+# not on the sheet. Responds with the person merged into.
